Teksto kapag: ['html'] gawin: { <- (
		sarili
		palitan: ['&'] ng: ['&amp;'],
		palitan: ['<'] ng: ['&lt;'],
		palitan: ['>'] ng: ['&gt;'],
		palitan: ['"'] ng: ['&quot;']
	).
}.

>> list := Listahan bago.

['Verbatim Syntax'] mga-titik bawat: { :bilang :letter
	list ; ((['<li>#Number:Letter</li>']) Number: (bilang), Letter: letter).
}.

Labas list.





>> template := ['
<html>
<body>
<p>Hello this is a test!</p>
<p>The string \‘Verbatim Syntax\’ has: 15 code points...</p>
<ul>
[list]
</ul>
</body> 
</html>
'] [list]: (list pagsamahin: ['↵']).

Labas isulat: template.

